ust than the latter  but honestly  that is a whole video in itself it's  also an  option that's free of added gums and  artificial sweeteners but you're  definitely  paying for all of those bells and  whistles it clocks in  at 3.33 per serving  so this may or may not be worth it to  you i cannot speak to the flavor  but i did try for stigmatics mushroom  coffee which you can watch  right here and let's just say  i wasn't a fan  it doesn't taste like it smells but do  let me know in the comments below if  you've tried this protein powder  and you thought it tasted good now i  also think it's important to mention  some of the companies that  could not confirm that they had been  third party tested  i not only checked the usual websites  for information about their testing  procedures  but our team also reached out to them  personally to see if they could offer  any more details so premium protein said  unfortunately the information that  you're requesting is proprietary  our ingredients are listed on the  packaging in order by weight  heaviest to lightest um okay now  bulk protein said we only do a third  party test  if we don't have an in-house method or  the proper equipment to test the  products  ourselves so to answer your question  that is a no  okay organe's website states  we carefully source our ingredients and  review testing to ensure  products conform to our rigid  specifications for quality  and consistency our products are tested  for arsenic  cadmium mercury and lead so that sounds  good  but they wouldn't answer our emails  regarding third party testing  and their website didn't confirm that  that had been done either  so it's very possible that they are  testing and the products are totally  safe and great however they may not be  third party tested  by an external source and finally  tropica  never answered my email about testing  and i could find  nothing online to confirm that they are  regularly tested  at all you suck so that's not to say  that th